    "Registry for spectral phase-vs-frequency datasets used to audit the phase->delay interface on spectral lines.",
    "Each dataset should provide either an explicit point cloud (omega, phi) or a deterministic toy model that materializes such points.",
    "This registry is network-free and uses explicit literals only."
  ],
