      "id": "hydrogen_21cm_toy_resonance_phase",
      "kind": "toy_resonance",
      "citation": "Toy one-channel unitary resonance phase model anchored at the hydrogen 21cm line (interface activation only).",
      "notes": [
        "This is a deterministic toy dataset (not an experimental record).",
        "It provides a phase response phi(omega)=arg S(omega) over a small omega band around omega0.",
        "Used to activate the spectral phase->delay audit interface."
      ],
